# Client Firebase config is never tracked. The console and the dashboard both
# receive it at runtime from the FIREBASE_WEB_CONFIG repository variable and
# serve it from /__/config.json and /api/config respectively. The values are
# public, but an AIza-prefixed key in the tree gets inlined into bundles, trips
# the Dockerfile secret gate, and lights up every scanner for no benefit.
# Both names are ignored so a local scratch copy cannot be committed back.
# See docs/security/CLIENT-CONFIG.md.
firebase-applet-config.json
firebase-applet-config.local.json
